        <img src="/images/gem.png" alt="" class="w500 glowImg2" style="transform: rotate(10deg); margin-top: 40px; margin-right: 10px;">
    </div>

    <div class="banda-hero-copy height0 width50 padding10 borderRadius20 col gap10 marginTop50" style="z-index: 100;">
        <p class="size40 str400">Creating Meaningful Moments Through Live Music</p>
        <p class="size20">Banda ni Shaho delivers unforgettable live performances for birthdays, weddings, festivals, and more</p>
        <div class="banda-hero-actions height0 justifyStart padding5 borderRadius15" style="gap:25px;">
