            <p class="size20 str400">Anniversary &bull; Festival &bull; Corporate Event</p>
            <p class="size20 str400">Baptism &bull; Charity Event &bull; Funeral</p>
            <p class="size20 str400">Community Gathering & Many More</p>
        </div>
    </div>
    <br>
    
    <div class="banda-gallery height0 gap10">
